        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks have achieved a striking new regime of precision and created powerful tools for metrology, geodesy, and fundamental tests.",
        "attribution": "Katori introduced the magic-wavelength lattice-clock concept, and Ye made foundational experimental advances and precision demonstrations.",
        "maturity": "Independent laboratories now demonstrate the claimed performance and deploy the technique widely.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "A full attribution assessment should distinguish the original clock architecture from subsequent accuracy advances."
